==Foraging==
[[File:MountainForageLocations.png|thumb|right|500px|Locations at the Mountain where forageable items can spawn.]]
[[Foraging|Forageable]] items found on the ground in the Mountain are:<ref name="forage_chance" />
* In [[Spring]]: {{Name|Leek|class=inline|58%}}, and {{Name|Wild Horseradish|class=inline|42%}}
* In [[Summer]]: {{Name|Grape|class=inline|62%}}, and {{Name|Spice Berry|class=inline|38%}}
* In [[Fall]]: {{Name|Hazelnut|class=inline|53%}}, {{Name|Common Mushroom|class=inline|24%}}, and {{Name|Wild Plum|class=inline|24%}}
* In [[Winter]]: {{Name|Crocus|class=inline|40%}}, {{Name|Crystal Fruit|class=inline|38%}}, and {{Name|Holly|class=inline|22%}}

Forageable items spawn at an average rate of 0.5 per night.<ref name="forage_spawn"/> The map shows the possible locations as red and magenta tiles; when the original trees are present, the magenta tiles have a 90% smaller chance of spawning items because they are identified as being behind the original trees.

